) -> tuple[str, str | None]:
    """Resolve athlete ID from parameter or default, with error message if missing.

    Args:
        athlete_id: Optional athlete ID parameter.
        default_athlete_id: Default athlete ID to use if athlete_id is None.

    Returns:
